WEBVTT

00:01.580 --> 00:05.210
<b>ANSEI YEAR 2 (1855)</b>

00:17.420 --> 00:19.380
<b>I don't know when I learned to live with this.</b>

00:20.420 --> 00:23.170
<b>Although I have no qualms
about hunting demons at this point,</b>

00:23.500 --> 00:27.540
<b>it feels like my blade is getting more clouded
with blood each time I slay one.</b>

00:30.920 --> 00:34.790
<b>Or... perhaps it's my heart that's clouded.</b>

02:13.500 --> 02:17.460
<b>Thanks for your help. Sorry that I can't pay you more.</b>

02:20.000 --> 02:24.580
<b>Beautiful snow. Like the moon in fall
and the flowers in spring...</b>

02:24.580 --> 02:29.330
<b>My lord was the type to enjoy such slices
of nature's elegance while he indulged in a drink.</b>

02:29.830 --> 02:34.960
<b>I plan to honor his memory by making him a grave
and pouring out a bottle of his favorite sake.</b>

02:36.830 --> 02:39.790
<b>I'll be going now. You have my gratitude.</b>

02:52.460 --> 02:55.250
<b>Dad, you're supposed to go easy on the booze!</b>

02:55.460 --> 02:57.580
<b>Oh, lighten up!</b>

02:57.580 --> 03:00.500
<b>I rarely get a day off like this. Here, join me.</b>

03:00.500 --> 03:03.330
<b>No thank you. It's the middle of the day!</b>

03:08.170 --> 03:13.670
<b>So, all the servants in the mansion and even the samurai
charged with protecting it just up and vanished?</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:18.040
<b>Yep. And then a dozen or so demons
made a lair out of it.</b>

03:18.040 --> 03:20.170
<b>Sounds like it was a busy night for you...</b>

03:20.170 --> 03:23.920
<b>Here, let me carry that! You must be tired.</b>

03:24.290 --> 03:27.580
<b>Don't worry about it.
Today's a day for celebration, remember?</b>

03:29.290 --> 03:31.290
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

03:31.290 --> 03:33.210
<b>Step right up, folks!</b>

03:33.290 --> 03:38.540
<b>KUNOYA SPIRITS</b>

03:33.380 --> 03:38.540
<b>I know you've been waiting for this!
A fresh shipment of Yuki-no-Nagori has arrived!</b>

03:38.540 --> 03:40.920
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:38.540 --> 03:40.920
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:38.710 --> 03:40.960
<b>One sip and it will steal your heart.</b>

03:40.960 --> 03:45.880
<b>One cup and it will send you to Heaven.
One bottle and you'll never be the same again.</b>

03:41.210 --> 03:42.960
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:43.250 --> 03:45.790
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:45.880 --> 03:51.920
<b>But don't take my word for it. Yuki-no-Nagori
is now in stock, so please try some for yourself!</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:49.130
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:49.130
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:51.830
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:51.830
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

03:51.920 --> 03:53.130
<b>Gimme three! Three bottles!</b>

03:53.290 --> 03:54.250
<b>Same here!</b>

03:53.290 --> 03:54.250
<b>Sake, eh?</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:56.080
<b>I want five of them!</b>

03:54.250 --> 03:56.080
<b>Everyone's going crazy for it.</b>

03:56.080 --> 03:57.330
<b>Should we buy some?</b>

03:57.330 --> 04:01.080
<b>No. Dealing with a crowd like that
is the last thing I want to do.</b>

04:01.080 --> 04:05.790
<b>Good point. We still have prep work to do,
so let's keep moving.</b>

04:05.790 --> 04:08.080
<b>Take it easy, folks! Don't trample me!</b>

04:09.630 --> 04:11.380
<b>Brrr! It's freezing!</b>

04:13.790 --> 04:16.250
<b>Hello, how's it going, everybody?</b>

04:16.250 --> 04:17.130
<b>Welcome!</b>

04:17.130 --> 04:18.580
<b>You're late, mister!</b>

04:18.580 --> 04:22.880
<b>Sorry, milady. The shop was just busy as all heck today.</b>

04:22.880 --> 04:26.920
<b>Well, this party is for you, anyways.
So I guess it doesn't matter.</b>

04:26.920 --> 04:29.130
<b>Now we're just waiting on Miura-sama.</b>

04:30.000 --> 04:31.130
<b>Hey, Naotsugu.</b>

04:31.130 --> 04:33.500
<b>Ah! My apologies for being late.</b>

04:33.500 --> 04:35.750
<b>I appreciate you making it out here.</b>

04:36.210 --> 04:39.000
<b>That's everybody. Shall we get started?</b>

04:39.580 --> 04:41.290
<b>KIHEI SOBA</b>

04:41.420 --> 04:44.670
<b>Shucks! I can't believe you're all here for lil' old me!</b>

04:44.670 --> 04:47.000
<b>Looking back, it's been 15 years
since I first started at Sugaya...</b>

04:47.000 --> 04:48.960
<b>You can skip the speech.</b>

04:49.250 --> 04:50.920
<b>Cold as ice, aren't you?</b>

04:51.290 --> 04:53.210
<b>Okay, I'll keep it simple.</b>

04:54.920 --> 04:59.880
<b>I'm happy to announce that your boy Zenji
has been promoted to the job of head clerk at Sugaya!</b>

05:00.170 --> 05:04.880
<b>It's a real pleasure to have you all here
to celebrate with me. My thanks to everyone for coming.</b>

05:05.080 --> 05:07.460
<b>Congratulations on the promotion, Zenji-san.</b>

05:07.630 --> 05:09.830
<b>Gosh! Thank you, Ofuu-san!</b>

05:10.170 --> 05:13.880
<b>Congrats. Make sure you help Jyuuzou-dono
as best you can.</b>

05:14.000 --> 05:16.250
<b>O-of course, you know I will!</b>

05:16.580 --> 05:19.040
<b>I'm gonna make Sugaya the biggest shop in town!</b>

05:19.420 --> 05:22.080
<b>I'm sure you'll do great, Zenji-dono.</b>

05:22.080 --> 05:25.500
<b>Just wait and see!
I'll be the greatest head clerk of all time!</b>

05:25.710 --> 05:27.420
<b>Already inflating his ego.</b>

05:27.420 --> 05:30.250
<b>Please, milady. Can't you let me have fun tonight?</b>

05:30.250 --> 05:31.750
<b>I'm just stating the facts.</b>

05:31.960 --> 05:33.750
<b>Okay, that's enough bickerin'.</b>

05:35.790 --> 05:37.790
<b>It's time for food! Dig in!</b>

05:38.790 --> 05:40.920
<b>Whoa, chicken hot pot!</b>

05:40.920 --> 05:44.000
<b>A special day like this calls for more
than just plain ol' soba.</b>

05:44.210 --> 05:46.500
<b>Congratulations on the promotion.</b>

05:46.500 --> 05:49.630
<b>Aw, pops! You're the best.</b>

05:50.130 --> 05:53.630
<b>We didn't forget about drinks, either. Here.</b>

05:56.290 --> 05:57.540
<b>Thank you kindly.</b>

05:59.630 --> 06:02.330
<b>Holy cow! This is primo kudari-zake!</b>

06:02.330 --> 06:04.540
<b>How'd you get your hands on this?!</b>

06:04.540 --> 06:07.080
<b>Jinya-kun procured some especially for you.</b>

06:07.080 --> 06:07.630
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:08.040 --> 06:09.790
<b>Well, it's a special occasion.</b>

06:11.290 --> 06:14.130
<b>Jeez, you're gonna turn me into a blubbering mess.</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:16.040
<b>Thanks for the awesome gift!</b>

06:16.460 --> 06:18.920
<b>Alrighty! Everybody chow down before it gets cold!</b>

06:33.250 --> 06:35.210
<b>KIHEI SOBA</b>

06:37.580 --> 06:39.960
<b>Oh, hey! I almost forgot.</b>

06:41.500 --> 06:42.790
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

06:44.000 --> 06:45.210
<b>What's that?</b>

06:46.380 --> 06:50.540
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

06:46.750 --> 06:48.830
<b>It's a trendy new sake.</b>

06:48.830 --> 06:51.630
<b>The boss has been drinking it every night
and raving about how good it is.</b>

06:51.920 --> 06:53.290
<b>My father, really?</b>

06:53.290 --> 06:56.790
<b>Yep. I figured today was good day
to share a bottle with everybody.</b>

06:56.960 --> 06:58.290
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori, huh?</b>

06:58.290 --> 07:03.580
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

06:58.290 --> 07:00.290
<b>Oh, you know about it, Jinya?</b>

07:00.540 --> 07:02.580
<b>They say this stuff is best served chilled, so...</b>

07:02.580 --> 07:04.000
<b>Please feel free to use these.</b>

07:04.460 --> 07:05.920
<b>Thanks a bunch.</b>

07:06.210 --> 07:08.290
<b>Now, let's see what all the fuss is about.</b>

07:07.630 --> 07:08.630
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

07:08.630 --> 07:10.500
<b>Uh, milady?</b>

07:10.880 --> 07:13.460
<b>You're the star of the party. Let me do the honors.</b>

07:14.500 --> 07:19.000
<b>I never thought the day would come I'd be drinking
booze from a cup poured by Lady Natsu.</b>

07:19.130 --> 07:20.880
<b>Living to old age was worth it!</b>

07:21.130 --> 07:23.000
<b>You're not even that old.</b>

07:23.250 --> 07:25.460
<b>I mean spiritually, ya know?</b>

07:25.460 --> 07:29.830
<b>Gosh! I'm so touched! She used to be
such a cheeky little brat, but now...</b>

07:30.040 --> 07:32.420
<b>I'll just pretend I didn't hear that.</b>

07:32.630 --> 07:33.790
<b>My bad.</b>

07:40.710 --> 07:43.170
<b>Hey, what's the big idea?!</b>

07:43.170 --> 07:48.630
<b>What the hell? It's salty, smelly,
and stings like a bitch. Literally undrinkable!</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:49.960
<b>Pardon, let me try.</b>

07:48.630 --> 07:49.960
<b>Are you okay?</b>

07:49.960 --> 07:51.670
<b>Should I bring you some water?</b>

07:52.080 --> 07:53.250
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

07:56.960 --> 08:01.290
<b>Urk! It certainly is strong.
Not something I would call "good"...</b>

08:01.420 --> 08:04.290
<b>What a shame. That really threw a damper on the party.</b>

08:04.500 --> 08:07.250
<b>Damn, how was I supposed to know?</b>

08:07.540 --> 08:09.920
<b>Oh, hey! Why don't you try some?</b>

08:11.330 --> 08:12.170
<b>Here.</b>

08:15.880 --> 08:19.000
<b>It's not bad. But pretty weak.</b>

08:19.130 --> 08:21.000
<b>"Weak" is not the word I'd use...</b>

08:21.000 --> 08:23.080
<b>Is this really the sake people are raging about?</b>

08:23.080 --> 08:25.790
<b>This is what the boss was drinking, I'm sure of it!</b>

08:26.130 --> 08:29.710
<b>Well, look, we've got plenty of other good stuff to drink!</b>

08:29.710 --> 08:31.170
<b>Right. Let's start this over.</b>

08:31.170 --> 08:32.790
<b>Would you care for some sashimi?</b>

08:33.290 --> 08:34.250
<b>Sounds great!</b>

08:35.000 --> 08:37.380
<b>Lucky for you that everybody's so kind and generous.</b>

08:37.380 --> 08:40.580
<b>But that's normal, milady.
You're the overly strict one here.</b>

08:40.790 --> 08:42.830
<b>My point is that you should be grateful!</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:45.330
<b>Whoa!</b>

08:43.880 --> 08:45.330
<b>Heads up!</b>

08:48.670 --> 08:51.630
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

08:53.000 --> 08:54.750
<b>You're drinking again?</b>

08:54.750 --> 08:56.830
<b>Yeah. What's it matter to you?</b>

08:57.420 --> 09:00.170
<b>C'mon, dad. You really need to cut back.</b>

09:00.170 --> 09:03.880
<b>Oh, shadddup! Don't snap at me for indulging a little!</b>

09:10.170 --> 09:12.960
<b>Why hello, ronin. Cold out, isn't it?</b>

09:13.500 --> 09:15.080
<b>I'm looking for work.</b>

09:15.460 --> 09:19.790
<b>Oh yeah? And you're so desperate
that you can't even make small talk with me first?</b>

09:22.080 --> 09:23.250
<b>Just teasing!</b>

09:24.170 --> 09:29.000
<b>I'm not sure if they'll lead you to work, but a lot of
bizarre stories have been making the rounds lately.</b>

09:29.210 --> 09:35.880
<b>Like a bedridden son getting swapped out with a demon,
or a pack of demons seen lurking under a bridge,</b>

09:36.250 --> 09:38.580
<b>or a restless woman wandering the streets at night.</b>

09:39.330 --> 09:40.830
<b>Seems like too many, doesn't it?</b>

09:41.630 --> 09:42.790
<b>Indeed.</b>

09:43.130 --> 09:48.210
<b>Well, we live in turbulent times. This all might just be
people's anxiety getting the better of them.</b>

09:48.880 --> 09:52.960
<b>"It only takes four cups of black tea
to keep us up at night," as they say.</b>

09:53.250 --> 09:55.040
<b>You mean the foreign ships in Uraga.</b>

09:55.500 --> 09:58.960
<b>Especially now, with the Emperor
acting like a lapdog for the Merikens.</b>

09:59.250 --> 10:02.170
<b>Evil runs rampant whenever society falls into chaos...</b>

10:02.630 --> 10:04.750
<b>That seems to be what's happening.</b>

10:05.000 --> 10:07.540
<b>There's a sake called
Yuki-no-Nagori selling like wildfire,</b>

10:07.540 --> 10:10.460
<b>probably because everybody
wants to drink their problems away.</b>

10:11.000 --> 10:13.290
<b>My customers often brag about getting it.</b>

10:13.500 --> 10:15.500
<b>Have they said anything about the flavor?</b>

10:16.290 --> 10:20.580
<b>"A taste so sublime it'll send you to Heaven."
Or something like that.</b>

10:22.130 --> 10:25.960
<b>Harlot. Will you do some digging into that sake for me?</b>

10:26.540 --> 10:28.710
<b>What for? Is it bad news?</b>

10:29.790 --> 10:33.330
<b>I'm not sure yet. Hopefully, it's just nothing.</b>

10:33.920 --> 10:36.710
<b>Hmmm. Fine, I'll do it.</b>

10:37.210 --> 10:38.040
<b>Thanks.</b>

10:38.670 --> 10:43.080
<b>But watch your back. Naotsugu would come
for my head if anything happened to you.</b>

10:45.040 --> 10:47.460
<b>Didn't know you could tell jokes!</b>

10:49.630 --> 10:52.380
<b>Ah, no wonder it's so cold out.</b>

11:11.000 --> 11:12.330
<b>Oh! There you are!</b>

11:14.580 --> 11:15.420
<b>Natsu?</b>

11:15.790 --> 11:19.330
<b>Good morning! Though, I guess it's already afternoon.</b>

11:19.460 --> 11:21.170
<b>I'm surprised you knew where to find me.</b>

11:21.250 --> 11:23.540
<b>Ofuu-san pointed me in the right direction.</b>

11:23.750 --> 11:27.580
<b>Go figure you'd be living in a place like this.
It's just a stone's throw away from Kihei.</b>

11:28.040 --> 11:30.380
<b>You could've told me,
it's not like we're strangers or anythi-</b>

11:30.380 --> 11:31.630
<b>Enough is enough!</b>

11:32.130 --> 11:34.920
<b>Shut it! Just go and buy me more booze, dammit!</b>

11:40.000 --> 11:42.170
<b>Wh-what was that?</b>

11:42.290 --> 11:46.880
<b>The family next door.
It seems the father is on another midday sake binge.</b>

11:47.960 --> 11:49.380
<b>Sake, huh...?</b>

11:49.540 --> 11:51.290
<b>So, what brings you here?</b>

11:53.670 --> 11:56.580
<b>Well, I need your help with something.</b>

11:57.460 --> 11:58.880
<b>So cool!</b>

11:57.460 --> 11:58.880
<b>Whoa, look at it go!</b>

11:59.580 --> 12:00.670
<b>Really, Zenji did?</b>

12:02.210 --> 12:07.040
<b>He's been skipping out on work to get plastered
at some bar down in Nihonbashi.</b>

12:07.710 --> 12:10.460
<b>Even though we just celebrated
his promotion to head clerk?</b>

12:11.330 --> 12:15.830
<b>He's been like this since the day after that.
Nothing but drinking all around the clock.</b>

12:16.540 --> 12:18.750
<b>My father is ready to call it the last straw.</b>

12:19.250 --> 12:21.460
<b>And what do want me to do about it?</b>

12:22.170 --> 12:25.710
<b>Honestly, I'm too scared to barge into a bar by myself.</b>

12:26.290 --> 12:28.420
<b>So I want you to come as my bodyguard.</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:33.710
<b>Please? I'll even pay you if you want.</b>

12:35.290 --> 12:36.630
<b>No payment necessary.</b>

12:37.210 --> 12:38.580
<b>You said Nihonbashi, right?</b>

12:48.330 --> 12:50.330
<b>Ugh, it reeks!</b>

12:54.210 --> 12:59.460
<b>Ohhh, hey milady! Welshome in! Diddya need somtin'?</b>

13:03.040 --> 13:07.880
<b>Don't give me that! You're skipping work
and coming here to get drunk off your ass!</b>

13:08.000 --> 13:14.460
<b>Wuts so bad about that? Couldja stop barking
like a dog and leave me in peash?</b>

13:15.040 --> 13:17.580
<b>This is the reason you're still single, ya know.</b>

13:17.710 --> 13:23.000
<b>But I doubt there's a guy alive who want
to get hitched to a harpy like you, anyways!</b>

13:28.580 --> 13:31.080
<b>Zenji... Why you little...!</b>

13:31.500 --> 13:36.080
<b>Huh? Don't you know how to take a hint?
Such an annoying brat.</b>

13:36.420 --> 13:38.080
<b>Get lost, already.</b>

13:38.330 --> 13:39.920
<b>That's more than enough.</b>

13:40.750 --> 13:42.380
<b>Mind your own damn business.</b>

13:42.630 --> 13:44.960
<b>Being drunk is no excuse for that kind of attitude.</b>

13:46.210 --> 13:49.040
<b>I don't take lectures from loser ronin.</b>

13:49.290 --> 13:53.710
<b>Listen here! You've rubbed me
the wrong way since day one.</b>

13:53.710 --> 13:55.330
<b>Cut it out, Zenji!</b>

13:55.630 --> 13:56.790
<b>You're drunk out of your gourd.</b>

13:58.130 --> 14:00.040
<b>Screw you, asshole!</b>

14:09.000 --> 14:11.130
<b>Sake is a gift from the heavens.</b>

14:11.670 --> 14:16.380
<b>Denying its joys to anyone is beyond the pale,
but turning to violence is just plain crass.</b>

14:16.380 --> 14:18.460
<b>H-hey, you hit him too hard!</b>

14:18.880 --> 14:20.460
<b>Not if you ask me.</b>

14:23.790 --> 14:26.040
<b>He needs to regurgitate this stuff.</b>

14:26.040 --> 14:27.750
<b>YUKI-NO-NAGORI</b>

14:27.420 --> 14:30.420
<b>Hey, jackass. Who died and made you king?!</b>

14:30.420 --> 14:32.080
<b>You can't pull that shit here!</b>

14:32.080 --> 14:33.210
<b>Yeah, mess him up!</b>

14:33.790 --> 14:36.420
<b>Wh-what is wrong with these people?!</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:40.540
<b>Jinya...</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:43.830
<b>Close your eyes for a bit. This won't last long.</b>

14:44.040 --> 14:45.630
<b>Shut your damn mouth!</b>

14:48.460 --> 14:48.960
<b>Eat this!</b>

15:14.130 --> 15:16.170
<b>Zenji! Are you okay, Zenji?!</b>

15:16.290 --> 15:17.210
<b>Zenji!</b>

15:17.960 --> 15:21.080
<b>He's just unconscious. Don't worry.</b>

15:22.500 --> 15:23.790
<b>Thank you.</b>

15:24.170 --> 15:28.290
<b>But jeez... you went and made
an absolute mess of the place.</b>

15:28.500 --> 15:30.250
<b>Well, I had a little help.</b>

15:30.580 --> 15:31.380
<b>Huh?</b>

15:31.920 --> 15:35.630
<b>Although I really doubt ya needed any.</b>

15:37.460 --> 15:39.920
<b>It saved me some trouble. Thank you.</b>

15:41.540 --> 15:45.130
<b>Still the same as ever, I see. How's life treating you?</b>

15:45.670 --> 15:48.830
<b>It's been some time, Somegoro Akitsu.</b>

15:49.540 --> 15:51.670
<b>The Third, remember?</b>

15:59.540 --> 16:04.210
<b>Huh? What am I doing here...?</b>

16:06.420 --> 16:07.630
<b>Milady...</b>

16:07.880 --> 16:10.250
<b>Oh, Zenji. You're back with us?</b>

16:10.250 --> 16:12.540
<b>M-Milady, I... ugh!</b>

16:14.330 --> 16:16.250
<b>Don't force yourself to get up.</b>

16:16.250 --> 16:17.790
<b>Listen, milady...</b>

16:18.080 --> 16:22.000
<b>I'm sorry! Like seriously, incredibly sorry!</b>

16:22.960 --> 16:24.540
<b>Does it still hurt?</b>

16:24.830 --> 16:26.880
<b>Yeah, a little bit...</b>

16:27.540 --> 16:31.460
<b>Good grief. He really should have gone easier on you.</b>

16:31.790 --> 16:33.170
<b>Well, too late now.</b>

16:34.250 --> 16:35.710
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:35.710 --> 16:38.210
<b>I don't need any apologies. Okay?</b>

16:38.420 --> 16:41.710
<b>Yeah, but, I said such awful things to you...</b>

16:41.710 --> 16:45.880
<b>I suppose. But have you forgotten your own advice?</b>

16:46.080 --> 16:47.630
<b>"That's not what matters most."</b>

16:53.040 --> 16:55.630
<b>I mean, sure, all those insults did hurt.</b>

16:55.960 --> 16:57.630
<b>But I know better.</b>

16:58.420 --> 17:05.540
<b>Because even if you meant what you said, you still
treasure me as a person. And that's what matters.</b>

17:06.170 --> 17:07.420
<b>Milady...</b>

17:08.580 --> 17:11.500
<b>So don't let it bother you too much, okay?</b>

17:11.830 --> 17:16.460
<b>I'm not naive enough to take what
people say when they're drunk at face value.</b>

17:17.170 --> 17:22.130
<b>Even so, I want to apologize.
There was something wrong with me...</b>

17:22.710 --> 17:26.500
<b>That's for sure. You even started swinging punches.</b>

17:26.630 --> 17:29.920
<b>I can't deny I was totally drunk at the time.</b>

17:30.080 --> 17:35.330
<b>The buzz had me riding high,
but for some reason it wasn't satisfying at all.</b>

17:35.330 --> 17:39.250
<b>And then when you showed up, I got oddly irritated.</b>

17:40.790 --> 17:44.920
<b>More so when it came to Jinya. I totally hated his guts.</b>

17:45.250 --> 17:47.380
<b>Except I have no idea why!</b>

17:47.540 --> 17:50.880
<b>Just let it go, Zenji. You need to rest.</b>

17:51.630 --> 17:53.130
<b>But, I...</b>

18:00.000 --> 18:01.540
<b>H-hello, boss!</b>

18:01.710 --> 18:04.500
<b>So, I hear you made a complete ass of yourself.</b>

18:04.750 --> 18:06.250
<b>My sincerest apologies...</b>

18:06.710 --> 18:09.000
<b>Consider this your last chance.</b>

18:14.130 --> 18:16.790
<b>Aw, man. What am I gonna do?</b>

18:17.080 --> 18:19.960
<b>The only thing you can do is make it up by working hard.</b>

18:23.960 --> 18:26.000
<b>Shut up! Quit crying!</b>

18:26.380 --> 18:28.210
<b>Just bring me the damn booze!</b>

18:27.210 --> 18:28.210
<b>Yeesh.</b>

18:28.210 --> 18:30.040
<b>They're really going at it.</b>

18:30.420 --> 18:34.170
<b>I've heard lots of talk about the heroic "demon hunter."</b>

18:34.330 --> 18:36.210
<b>Quite the celebrity, aint'cha?</b>

18:36.580 --> 18:38.210
<b>To an extent, yes.</b>

18:39.330 --> 18:40.960
<b>What were you hanging around that bar for?</b>

18:41.380 --> 18:44.460
<b>Well, something funny's been happening in Kyoto.</b>

18:45.790 --> 18:48.830
<b>I heard about a fella who stabbed
his little brother to death.</b>

18:48.830 --> 18:52.630
<b>Now, normally, that's not enough to catch my attention.</b>

18:52.830 --> 18:56.040
<b>But then a string of violent incidents
started happening right after that one.</b>

18:56.750 --> 19:00.290
<b>It gave me bad vibes, so I went digging.</b>

19:00.460 --> 19:03.630
<b>Turns out, the victim in that first case bought
an unusual sake for his brother,</b>

19:03.630 --> 19:06.080
<b>who then got drunk enough to commit the murder.</b>

19:06.460 --> 19:09.750
<b>Ditto for the other incidents,
everybody was drinking booze.</b>

19:09.920 --> 19:14.580
<b>And it's all the same kind,
some expensive brand that comes from Edo.</b>

19:14.880 --> 19:16.670
<b>Smells fishy, don't it?</b>

19:18.790 --> 19:20.500
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori.</b>

19:20.630 --> 19:23.420
<b>I've been trying to trace where it's coming from.</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:31.080
<b>Did you find any other clues in Kyoto?</b>

19:31.290 --> 19:34.540
<b>Let me think. There's not much else,
aside from a strange woman</b>

19:34.540 --> 19:37.960
<b>who people kept seeing
around the time of each incident.</b>

19:38.080 --> 19:39.040
<b>A woman?</b>

19:39.290 --> 19:44.880
<b>Yep. Doesn't really fit the image of a booze hawker,
so it's possible she's not even involved.</b>

19:45.960 --> 19:49.580
<b>Say, buddy. How're you planning
to learn more about the sake?</b>

19:50.170 --> 19:52.250
<b>A simple threat should loosen some lips.</b>

19:52.250 --> 19:55.540
<b>Jeez, you're a real brute, ya know that?</b>

19:56.000 --> 19:58.960
<b>KUNOYA SPIRITS</b>

20:02.540 --> 20:03.380
<b>Blood.</b>

20:15.000 --> 20:16.750
<b>Yikes. What a mess.</b>

20:16.960 --> 20:20.040
<b>I've seen this man before. He's the owner of this shop.</b>

20:20.380 --> 20:21.960
<b>Well, ain't that a real pisser.</b>

20:22.130 --> 20:25.540
<b>Can't exactly put the screws to a fella
that's already dead, can ya?</b>

20:25.750 --> 20:26.420
<b>It's gone.</b>

20:26.580 --> 20:27.380
<b>What is?</b>

20:27.580 --> 20:30.500
<b>Yuki-no-Nagori. There's not a single bottle.</b>

20:30.710 --> 20:34.080
<b>Just sold out? Or something more sinister?</b>

20:35.380 --> 20:38.460
<b>Take a look-see. This is the only area untouched.</b>

20:39.040 --> 20:43.960
<b>And there's no dust on these shelves,
which means they were constantly stocked up.</b>

20:45.380 --> 20:49.080
<b>The thugs who broke in must have been
throwing a hissy fit over the fact</b>

20:49.080 --> 20:51.380
<b>they couldn't get their hands on something.</b>

20:51.670 --> 20:56.040
<b>Until they finally found some here
and carefully hauled it off...</b>

20:57.000 --> 20:59.330
<b>It must've been Yuki-no-Nagori.</b>

21:00.250 --> 21:04.330
<b>But is a few bottles of expensive sake
really worth killing over?</b>

21:04.670 --> 21:08.790
<b>We're talkin' about thugs who stole booze
that makes people go off their rocker when they drink it.</b>

21:09.080 --> 21:10.960
<b>You know they ain't thinkin' straight.</b>

21:11.080 --> 21:12.920
<b>You have a point.</b>

21:14.250 --> 21:16.290
<b>Go, my paper swallow!</b>

21:23.380 --> 21:24.880
<b>That's quite the weapon.</b>

21:24.880 --> 21:26.210
<b>Well, you can't have it!</b>

21:26.630 --> 21:27.630
<b>What's your take?</b>

21:27.790 --> 21:31.290
<b>The demons smelled all the booze
and wanted to join the party, perhaps?</b>

21:31.630 --> 21:33.670
<b>Hard to say if that's a joke or not.</b>

21:42.790 --> 21:44.540
<b>Hm? More snow?</b>

21:45.130 --> 21:46.920
<b>It's been coming down every night lately.</b>

21:48.210 --> 21:48.960
<b>Yeah.</b>

21:50.460 --> 21:51.790
<b>It gives me a bad feeling.</b>
